      "shortDescription": "全新武器和可选物种降临熔炉密林！加入爪克龙，挥舞他们的传奇巨剑征服密林，击退凶恶的爪克龙子体！",
      "detailedDescription": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >全新武器和可选物种降临熔炉密林！加入爪克龙，挥舞他们的传奇巨剑征服密林，击退凶恶的爪克龙子体！</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>扮演全新种族：爪克龙！</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >从火山的另一边振翅而来的是我们的全新可选种族——爪克龙！随心混搭琳琅满目的独特身体组件与动画表情，以一身鳞甲的独特风格征服熔炉密林。<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5067220/extras/966f642430eaf8e1ae70efdc30068a3d.poster.avif?t=1790874934\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5067220/extras/966f642430eaf8e1ae70efdc30068a3d.webm?t=1790874934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5067220/extras/966f642430eaf8e1ae70efdc30068a3d.mp4?t=1790874934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>在新委托中，帮助爪克龙找回被盗走的仪式甲胄！</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >帮助爪克龙武僧天地和尚，踏上寻回寺院失窃仪式甲胄的征程。他的信仰与未来皆悬于一线！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5067220/extras/f93ab91f1bd0e53e515da081119974c7.poster.avif?t=1790874934\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5067220/extras/f93ab91f1bd0e53e515da081119974c7.webm?t=1790874934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5067220/extras/f93ab91f1bd0e53e515da081119974c7.mp4?t=1790874934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>新武器类型：巨剑！</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >巨剑加入武器架家族，让猎人们在对抗落腐精时占尽优势。挥舞沉重的剑刃，掌握势大力沉的招式，再进入狂暴状态，彻底放飞自我！<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5067220/extras/7b10c3dcfdbaaefaceb64138348893e0.poster.avif?t=1790874934\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5067220/extras/7b10c3dcfdbaaefaceb64138348893e0.webm?t=1790874934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5067220/extras/7b10c3dcfdbaaefaceb64138348893e0.mp4?t=1790874934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>爪克龙剑甲包</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >全新武器和可选物种降临熔炉密林！加入爪克龙，挥舞他们的传奇巨剑征服密林，击退凶恶的爪克龙子体！<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5067220/extras/52cd77d9009e9a5fdbc56aa35ade6247.poster.avif?t=1790874934\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5067220/extras/52cd77d9009e9a5fdbc56aa35ade6247.webm?t=1790874934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5067220/extras/52cd77d9009e9a5fdbc56aa35ade6247.mp4?t=1790874934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>搜刮武器库的战利品！</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >全新装备和个性饰品散落在熔炉密林各处，等你一一发现！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>特色内容</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >新武器类型：巨剑</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >新可选种族：爪克龙</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+种可解锁的巨剑款式</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >巨剑专属的新武器神力</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在新委托中挑战两名全新小头目</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >可解锁的全新护具幻影</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
